Package: authelia-admin
Version: @VERSION@
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Architecture: @ARCH@
Installed-Size: @INSTALLED_SIZE@
Maintainer: @MAINTAINER@
Depends: adduser, libc6 (>= 2.35), libstdc++6, libatomic1
Homepage: https://github.com/digennarot/authelia-admin
Description: Web administration interface for Authelia
 Authelia Admin is a web control panel for managing an Authelia
 deployment: TOTP configurations, banned users and IPs, and users and
 groups in LLDAP.
 .
 The package ships its own Node.js runtime, so it does not depend on
 the system nodejs package. That runtime needs libatomic1 and glibc 2.28
 or newer. The native sqlite3 module is built on Ubuntu 22.04, so the
 package loads on Ubuntu 22.04 and newer.
